{"3977320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grave Of Voices", "steam_appid": 3977320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grave Of Voices</strong> is a first-person horror adventure that follows Ryan Morgan, a young horror vlogger searching for his next big story. After discovering Ashfall, a town erased from the map, he becomes trapped in a nightmare of abandoned ruins, underground catacombs, and secrets that were never meant to be uncovered.                                      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/149110485e7fff1ba402d3429538055e.avif?t=1786223975\" width=195 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/2af11acd63f93baa97dbf33b3a7e4e23.poster.avif?t=1786223975\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/2af11acd63f93baa97dbf33b3a7e4e23.webm?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/2af11acd63f93baa97dbf33b3a7e4e23.mp4?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore a variety of locations, from quiet streets and abandoned buildings to dark underground catacombs. Each area has its own atmosphere, layout, and sense of unease. Subtle sound design and environmental details shape the experience, making exploration feel calm at times and deeply unsettling at others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/12c6e90f669ddfbe4cccd66b3b1a5842.avif?t=1786223975\" width=534 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/d53d685a3d47807ef08a2d02d0294811.poster.avif?t=1786223975\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/d53d685a3d47807ef08a2d02d0294811.webm?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/d53d685a3d47807ef08a2d02d0294811.mp4?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/d71d32bcc0902977621fc57f356e67d7.poster.avif?t=1786223975\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/d71d32bcc0902977621fc57f356e67d7.webm?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/d71d32bcc0902977621fc57f356e67d7.mp4?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape the town, you must solve a variety of environmental puzzles. Some require careful observation and interaction, while others force you to think quickly as you fight monsters. You will rotate mechanisms, place objects, and unlock paths forward, never knowing which puzzle will give you time to think and which one will put you in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/a037e0b5880c1bff23f30f41cf0b14f2.avif?t=1786223975\" width=534 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/5456cd997548f54f8c827a1f5ef7a873.poster.avif?t=1786223975\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/5456cd997548f54f8c827a1f5ef7a873.webm?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/5456cd997548f54f8c827a1f5ef7a873.mp4?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is uncovered through exploration. Notes, journals, and environmental details reveal what happened to the town and the people who once lived there. As you descend underground, hallucinations begin to blur reality, raising questions about who sent the email that brought you here and whether your arrival was truly just normal curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/54a7246960656f60494a97f2aeccf22f.avif?t=1786223975\" width=195 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/255459efcc81a515df14365f57b591e4.avif?t=1786223975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras_big/255459efcc81a515df14365f57b591e4.webp?t=1786223975 width=1560 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not know what is hunting you. Some enemies look almost human, others clearly are not, and many cannot be fought at all. Survival depends on reading the situation and deciding when to fight and when to disappear. You cannot stay hidden forever, though. To escape, you have to keep moving, and whatever is out there may already know where you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for a way out, survive what hunts the town, and uncover the truth hidden beneath it. Every step brings you closer to escape or deeper into something you were never meant to find. <strong>The choice is yours.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grave Of Voices</strong> is a first-person horror adventure that follows Ryan Morgan, a young horror vlogger searching for his next big story. After discovering Ashfall, a town erased from the map, he becomes trapped in a nightmare of abandoned ruins, underground catacombs, and secrets that were never meant to be uncovered.                                      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/149110485e7fff1ba402d3429538055e.avif?t=1786223975\" width=195 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/2af11acd63f93baa97dbf33b3a7e4e23.poster.avif?t=1786223975\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/2af11acd63f93baa97dbf33b3a7e4e23.webm?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/2af11acd63f93baa97dbf33b3a7e4e23.mp4?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore a variety of locations, from quiet streets and abandoned buildings to dark underground catacombs. Each area has its own atmosphere, layout, and sense of unease. Subtle sound design and environmental details shape the experience, making exploration feel calm at times and deeply unsettling at others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/12c6e90f669ddfbe4cccd66b3b1a5842.avif?t=1786223975\" width=534 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/d53d685a3d47807ef08a2d02d0294811.poster.avif?t=1786223975\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/d53d685a3d47807ef08a2d02d0294811.webm?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/d53d685a3d47807ef08a2d02d0294811.mp4?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/d71d32bcc0902977621fc57f356e67d7.poster.avif?t=1786223975\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/d71d32bcc0902977621fc57f356e67d7.webm?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/d71d32bcc0902977621fc57f356e67d7.mp4?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape the town, you must solve a variety of environmental puzzles. Some require careful observation and interaction, while others force you to think quickly as you fight monsters. You will rotate mechanisms, place objects, and unlock paths forward, never knowing which puzzle will give you time to think and which one will put you in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/a037e0b5880c1bff23f30f41cf0b14f2.avif?t=1786223975\" width=534 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/5456cd997548f54f8c827a1f5ef7a873.poster.avif?t=1786223975\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/5456cd997548f54f8c827a1f5ef7a873.webm?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/5456cd997548f54f8c827a1f5ef7a873.mp4?t=1786223975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is uncovered through exploration. Notes, journals, and environmental details reveal what happened to the town and the people who once lived there. As you descend underground, hallucinations begin to blur reality, raising questions about who sent the email that brought you here and whether your arrival was truly just normal curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/54a7246960656f60494a97f2aeccf22f.avif?t=1786223975\" width=195 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras/255459efcc81a515df14365f57b591e4.avif?t=1786223975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/extras_big/255459efcc81a515df14365f57b591e4.webp?t=1786223975 width=1560 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not know what is hunting you. Some enemies look almost human, others clearly are not, and many cannot be fought at all. Survival depends on reading the situation and deciding when to fight and when to disappear. You cannot stay hidden forever, though. To escape, you have to keep moving, and whatever is out there may already know where you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for a way out, survive what hunts the town, and uncover the truth hidden beneath it. Every step brings you closer to escape or deeper into something you were never meant to find. <strong>The choice is yours.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Ryan Morgan, a 21-year-old horror vlogger, thought he had found the perfect lead for his next video. But when he enters Ashfall, a town erased from the map, he realizes he's trapped in the catacombs below. To escape, he must solve puzzles, scavenge, hide from inhuman creatures, and fight to survive.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/d05ef3f3bd1410798de17e76306aa2b268f6fbc4/header.jpg?t=1786223975", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977320/582474daa546f99730b78470de81deb0e63505d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786223975", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a